				\begin{document}$$\Delta G={\mathrm{RT}}\times {\mathrm{ln}}({K}_{{\mathrm{d}}}),$$\end{document}ΔG=RT×ln(Kd),where R is the ideal gas constant, T is the temperature and Kd is the dissociation constant; and2\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
